From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vincent Knight <gallantcrusader@proton.me>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 21:42:00 +0000
Subject: [DEVELOPMENT PATCH 3/3] drm/asahi: Kconfig: add non-functional G15
 candidate gate

Development only. Add DRM_ASAHI_G15_CANDIDATE, default n and hidden
behind EXPERT. It compiles the T6030/G15 scaffolding from the previous
two patches. The option comes last so that it can only be enabled once
both the scaffolding and its probe refusal are present. With it unset
all new code is compiled out, and the driver matches and probes exactly
as before.

The scaffolding carries only the device-derived T6030 GPU identity.
Every firmware-facing value is a reverse-engineering-gated zero
placeholder, and probe refuses G15 before touching the hardware.

No Makefile change is needed: hw/t603x.rs is a module of the single
asahi.rs crate root, which obj-$(CONFIG_DRM_ASAHI) already builds.

No native validation. Not selected by any canonical or development boot
build. hardware_acceptance=false.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/Kconfig | 17 +++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 17 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/Kconfig b/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/Kconfig
index dfc8987..a26dab2 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/Kconfig
@@ -36,3 +36,20 @@ config DRM_ASAHI_DEBUG_ALLOCATOR
 
 	  Say N unless you are debugging firmware structures or porting to a
 	  new firmware version.
+
+config DRM_ASAHI_G15_CANDIDATE
+	bool "Non-functional Apple G15 (M3 Pro, T6030) scaffolding"
+	depends on DRM_ASAHI
+	depends on EXPERT
+	help
+	  Build reverse-engineering-gated scaffolding for the Apple G15 GPU
+	  in the T6030 (M3 Pro) SoC: G15 identity enums, a T6030 hardware
+	  configuration whose firmware-facing values are all RE-gated zero
+	  placeholders, and an "apple,agx-t6030" match whose probe always
+	  fails with -ENODEV before touching the hardware.
+
+	  This does NOT add working M3 Pro GPU support. No G15 firmware ABI,
+	  ID register decoding, power tables or GPU manager exist yet, and
+	  nothing here has been validated on hardware.
+
+	  Say N unless you are extracting G15 firmware values.
